 "title": "BZT52C2V0 to BZT52C75: 350 mW silicon Zener diodes, 2.0 V to 75 V, SOD-123",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.1",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "A family of 38 single silicon Zener diodes in the SOD-123 surface-mount package, rated 350 mW, with nominal Zener voltages from 2.0 V to 75 V. Each type is told apart by its two-character marking code. Typical uses are voltage references in regulated supplies and clamps against overvoltage. BZT52C10 is the 10 V type: 9.50 V to 10.50 V at 5 mA, marking WF.",
