   "text": "From 2.4 V to 51 V the VZ window is the nominal value ±5 %. The 2.0 V type spans 1.80 V to 2.15 V, and from 56 V upward the window is wider (56 V: 52.0 V to 60.0 V). ZZT is lowest, 10 Ω max, for the 6.2 V type and rises toward both ends of the range: 150 Ω for 2.0 V and 300 Ω for 75 V."
